OL,3,GNEWSAGiant aubergine grower Maggie says
OL,4,Ashe 'never expected to win' at national
OL,5,Aveg competition
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe results are in for the UK's biggest
OL,8,Fvegetables at the national championship
OL,9,Fin Malvern
OL,11,FFrom the heaviest marrow to the longest
OL,12,Frunner bean, winners in more than 30
OL,13,Fcategories have been picked
OL,15,FMaggie Walter's prize-winning aubergine
OL,16,Fweighed in at 3.95kg
OL,18,FA total of seven world records have
OL,19,Fbeen provisionally set, including for
OL,20,Fthe heaviest beetroot and sunflower
OL,21,Fhead
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
