OL,3,GNEWSAGiant aubergine grower Maggie says
OL,4,Ashe 'never expected to win' at national
OL,5,Aveg competition
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis year's competition comes after the
OL,8,FUK's hottest summer on record, with
OL,9,Ffarmers telling our reporter that a
OL,10,F"brutal" few months has left them
OL,11,F"feeling the financial pressure"
OL,13,FDerek Hulme, another of this year's
OL,14,Fcontestants, says the summer's
OL,15,Fheatwaves "played havoc" with his veg
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
